&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:8.3pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-4.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.0pt;font-size:9.0pt;"&gt;（特別口座）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:8.3pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-4.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.0pt;font-size:9.0pt;"&gt;東京都千代田区丸の内一丁目４番５号&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:8.3pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-4.5pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.0pt;font-size:9.0pt;"&gt;三菱ＵＦＪ信託銀行株式会社　証券代行部&lt;/p&gt;
