&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height:17pt;min-height:17pt;"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblL" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:4.5pt;padding-right:4.5pt;margin-top:1.5pt;margin-bottom:1.5pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:10.0pt;"&gt;    株主名簿管理人&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align:middle;border-left-style:solid;border-left-width:0.75pt;border-right-style:solid;border-right-width:0.75pt;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:3.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.0pt;font-size:9.0pt;"&gt;（特別口座）&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:3.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.0pt;font-size:9.0pt;"&gt;東京都千代田区丸の内一丁目４番５号&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:3.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13.0pt;font-size:9.0pt;"&gt;三菱ＵＦＪ信託銀行株式会社&lt;/p&gt;
